# Model checkpoints ARE tracked - see the nine artifacts already under models_saved/.
# Only scratch and smoke artifacts are excluded. A blanket /models_saved/ rule was added
# in 8c3a1f4 alongside /data/ and /reports/; because git ignore rules do not apply to
# already-tracked files, the existing models kept working while every checkpoint created
# afterwards was silently left untracked (BANK.md Entries 017 and 040).
models_saved/*_smoke.pt
models_saved/*_experimental*.pt
data/synthetic/**/*.npy
data/RML2016.10a_dict.pkl
data/2018.01/
.radiofry_upload.*
reports/*.png
/data/
/reports/